#ENHYPEN has generously donated 100 MILLION WON (US$68,177) to support flood recovery efforts in the Philippines! 👏😇💯Ⓜ️💥🌊⛈️🇵🇭👑👑👑👑👑👑👑💙
“We became aware of the recent severe flooding affecting many communities across the Philippines, a country that has long been close to our hearts. We wanted to offer our support, even in a small way, and sincerely hope the contributions will be used to help those in need and assist in the ongoing recovery efforts. Our hearts are with the local community and fans during this challenging time." - ENHYPEN 

